== Trivia ==
*'''Geonathan Greatforge''' is one of the two NPCs in the [[Crystal Hollows]] with set coordinates, the other being [[Emissary Sisko]].
*'''Geonathan Greatforge''' is most likely related to [[Jotraeline Greatforge]], who shares the same surname and profession as him.

